<title>POLAND: KROSNO APRIL NET FLAT AT PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KROSNO APRIL NET FLAT AT PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.11 vs   1.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.59 vs   1.88</p>
